This repository derives its site structure, build tooling, and authoring method
from korea100 (https://github.com/hosungseo/korea100) and korea100studio
(https://github.com/hosungseo/korea100studio). Its procurement framing follows
how-did-they-do-all-that-procurement
(https://github.com/Milkbuttercheese2/how-did-they-do-all-that-procurement),
which adapts korea100 to the public procurement domain. All three are released
under the MIT License. The original copyright notices above are retained as
those projects publish them.

